  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sonagazi 220 MW Solar Power and Livelihoods Improvement Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project Development Objective: 



The project&#x2019;s overarching development objective is to contribute to the nationwide economic development and improvement of living standard by supporting towards the achievement of the national power generation capacity target of 40,000 MW by 2030. 



The specific objectives include:

i) To increase total electricity from renewable energy sources.

ii) To contribute to reducing carbon emission.

iii) Livelihoods of the people will be improved through agricultural activities on the project land.</narrative>
  </description>
